@host = http://localhost:5169

### Вход администратора
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Admin@Company.ru ",
  "password": "Admin_dev_123"
}

### Неверный пароль
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@company.ru",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Несуществующая почта
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@company.ru",
  "password": "whatever"
}